      "lines": [
        "$\\int_a^b f(x)dx=F(b)-F(a)$。　（1）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个等式叫做**牛顿-莱布尼兹公式**。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 1　求 $\\int_{-1}^2 x^2dx$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为对于函数 $f(x)=x^2$，函数 $\\frac{x^3}{3}$ 是它的原函数，那么",
        "$\\int_{-1}^2 x^2dx=\\frac{2^3}{3}-\\frac{(-1)^3}{3}=3$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了书写方便，原函数的改变量 $F(b)-F(a)$ 采用简略",
        "记号 $\\left.F(x)\\right|_a^b$ 表示，就是",
        "$F(b)-F(a)=\\left.F(x)\\right|_a^b$。　（2）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "采用这个记号后，牛顿-莱布尼兹公式通常写成",
        "$\\int_a^b f(x)dx=\\left.F(x)\\right|_a^b$。　（3）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 2",
        "$\\int_0^\\pi \\sin xdx=\\left.-\\cos x\\right|_0^\\pi=-\\cos\\pi-(-\\cos 0)=2$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在，我们可以把第 100 小节对于曲边梯形面积（图 48）",
        "的（1）式写成下面的形式：",
        "$S=\\int_a^b f(x)dx$。　（4）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，非负函数的积分是对应曲边梯形的面积，这就是",
        "积分的几何意义。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
